' Evidence: Laplace/app/Laplace.Endpoints.OpenAICompat/RefactorProxyMiddleware.cs SHA256 15d0270bb3e760900da8438f459419db045ed4db457963c9f839bdfc05175664
' Evidence: Laplace/app/Laplace.Endpoints.OpenAICompat/Program.cs SHA256 97454cdfa33b2c0bdd7eef44de4d6ee79c82732207d2f655b573d2ba1f2f816b
skinparam backgroundColor #FAFCFF
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName SansSerif
title Monorepo — fixed-origin Refactor streaming proxy
start
:Reject CONNECT with 405;
:Require literal /refactor/ raw target; reject control, backslash and fragment;
:Strip prefix; concatenate fixed http://127.0.0.1:55434;
:Preserve escaped path/query; assert fixed authority;
:Stream request body; forward end-to-end headers;
:Remove Host and hop-by-hop/Connection-nominated headers;
:Send without redirects, cookies, proxy or decompression;
:Ten-second connection timeout; no overall client timeout;
if (Upstream switches protocol?) then (yes)
 :502; stop;
 stop
endif
:Forward status and end-to-end response headers;
:Disable buffering; SSE sets X-Accel-Buffering=no;
:Start response; HEAD/204/304 return without body;
:Otherwise read/write/flush each chunk until end;
note right
 Caller cancellation aborts client response.
 Transport failure before response start gives 502;
 after response start aborts connection.
end note
stop
footer
Source-reviewed orchestration. Nested semantics remain open; no runtime acceptance
claimed. Entire proxy reviewed. It adds no credential, but forwards incoming end-to-end
Authorization/Cookie headers unless excluded by Connection. Upstream authentication is a
separate boundary. It does not support CONNECT or protocol upgrade. Client-owned
cancellation controls streams; pooled buffers are returned in finally.
end footer

@enduml
